  awplus(config)# no mail smtpserver tls
  awplus(config)# do show mail -> Use TLS gone; SMTP Server / Authentication crammd5 /
                                  Username ckmail / Port 11025 all retained
RESULT: NO silent discard between `authentication`, `port` and `tls`. They are independent
config lines and each survives the others. This is the NEGATIVE result the dispatch asked for,
and it is reported as a negative result, not as an absence of testing.
STEP VERDICT: PASS.

