  it expected from ITS password and got a different one from the DUT's. Two digests, same
  challenge, different passwords. Combined with A4 (same password, different challenge ->
  5ba070f6..., not 14585b46...), this proves the DUT computes HMAC-MD5 over the SERVER'S
  CHALLENGE using the CONFIGURED PASSWORD -- it is not a constant, not a stored hash, and not
  a replay.

